%li.jpost#admin
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.fa.fa-plus
    %h3.name Corporate Assistant

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        San Francisco, CA

      %p Nitrous.IO is searching for a company operations manager / magician who can help streamline the day-to-day operations at the company.  The ideal candidate will be comfortable wearing many hats and is interested in challenging themselves and growing in a variety of different capacities as we keep up with our remarkable growth.

      %p This role is part operations, admin assistant, human resources, and support assistant all rolled-in to one.  The ideal candidate will have previous experience in an operating or finance position at a fast growing company.

      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Expense reporting
          %li Visa and travel arrangements
          %li Maintain HR standards and organization charts
          %li Assist with food orders, event planning, etc...
          %li Assist with communicating with finance team

      %h4 Requirements
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Previous experience supporting senior management.
          %li Strong skills with microsoft excel, word
          %li Previously responsible for major company accounts

      %p.actions
        To apply, please send us the following:

        %p.reqs
          %ul
            %li Resume / LinkedIn
            %li A few paragraphs on why you like working for startups

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Corporate%20Assistant', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"
